#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:88
#: 70cb76fd43b549758a67d0cfcebc9204
msgid ""
"Instead of using a UART serial connection to control the gimbal, an Ethernet"
" virtual serial connection may also be used, as well as transmitting a video"
" stream from the camera."
msgstr "除使用 UART 串行连接控制云台外，还可使用以太网虚拟串行连接，同时传输相机视频流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:94
#: d53f85bcf60945dba16b6c56b7bd8da3
msgid ""
"An example of the setup of the gimbal in a networked ArduPilot vehicle "
"system is detailed in :ref:`common-ethernet-vehicle` but in short, to "
"control the gimbal over Ethernet"
msgstr ""
":ref:`common-ethernet-vehicle` 中详细介绍了在网络化 ArduPilot "
"飞行器系统中设置云台的示例，简而言之，通过以太网控制云台的方法如下"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:96
#: 0984f96cc807472791590daa0284dc5d
msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal and autopilot using an :ref:`ethernet adapter <common-"
"ethernet-adapters>`"
msgstr "使用 :ref:`以太网适配器 <common-ethernet-adapters>` 连接云台和飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:97
#: 8b448eba684c4ec4b6c9c14c4400d42e
msgid ""
"Ensure the autopilot and gimbal are on the same subnet (e.g the first 3 "
"octets of the IP address match, 4th octet is different)"
msgstr "确保飞控和云台在同一子网（例如 IP 地址前三组相同，第四组不同）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:99
#: a252b616847749b78b0d706cbc2c35b1
msgid ""
"The gimbal's IP address can be set using the Siyi Assistant software (see "
"image below)"
msgstr "可使用 Siyi Assistant 软件设置云台的 IP 地址（见下图）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:100
#: 5cbbd67843d642c0affbb1fa1677db4d
msgid ""
"Set the autopilot's :ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` = 1 and reboot to enable "
"networking"
msgstr "将飞控的 :ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` 设为 1 并重启以启用网络"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:101
#: d32cf9831f224862849c73329f9829b6
msgid ""
"Set the autopilot's IP address using :ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>`, "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>`, :ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>`, "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>` (e.g. 192.168.144.14)"
msgstr ""
"使用 "
":ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>`、:ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>`"
" 设置飞控 IP 地址（例如 192.168.144.14）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:102
#: 2f85167254aa4321b8e9420a38fe5639
msgid "Create a serial connection over ethernet"
msgstr "创建以太网串行连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:104
#: 1a93d7f56cfa4f4a9a770fe4c4513765
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1 (UDP Client) and reboot the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "将 :ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` 设为 1（UDP Client）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:105
#: 05903a615f4b4725a03d27444fb3e509
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`, "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`, :ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>` to the gimbal's"
" IP address (e.g. 192.168.144.25)"
msgstr ""
"将 "
":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>`、:ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>`"
" 设为云台的 IP 地址（例如 192.168.144.25）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:106
#: 5d25fa6712614438854a2b2d38cdfc6d
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 37260 (port that Siyi gimbals listens "
"for commands on)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` 设为 37260（Siyi 云台监听命令的端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:107
#: edf08561ee454d4296a7cb065f59e87f
msgid "Set :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 8 (Gimbal)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` 设为 8（Gimbal）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:109
#: 7b2e9c6fc00a49418a142846181346a8
msgid ""
"To view the Siyi cammera's live video over Ethernet use the Siyi Assistant "
"to set the \"IP Config\", \"Coding Format\" and Video Output mode as shown "
"below.  Note that the IP's first three numbers should match the telemetry "
"system being used (e.g. :ref:`Herelink <common-herelink>`, Siyi MK32, etc) "
"or PC the camera is connected to.  In image below shows the default IP "
"address for Siyi gimbals"
msgstr ""
"若要通过以太网查看 Siyi 相机的实时视频，请使用 Siyi Assistant 设置如下图所示的「IP Config」、「Coding "
"Format」和视频输出模式。注意 IP 的前三组数字应与所用数传系统（如 :ref:`Herelink <common-herelink>`、Siyi"
" MK32 等）或连接相机的 PC 相匹配。下图显示了 Siyi 云台的默认 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:114
#: 0c2740404ba24775a58500cfaf78d2a5
msgid ""
"The video is available using an RTSP URL which can vary by camera type.  "
"Note the URL's IP address should match the camera's IP address that was "
"entered into the Siyi Assistant above"
msgstr ""
"视频可通过 RTSP URL 访问，具体 URL 因相机类型而异。注意 URL 中的 IP 地址应与上面输入 Siyi Assistant 的相机 IP"
" 地址一致"

