#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-zr10-gimbal.rst:133
#: b993f50c284c4e5b833489f4c808e726
msgid ""
"If using Mission Planner, the live video can be displayed on the Data screen"
" by following :ref:`these instructions <planner:live-video>`"
